WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.590
One computer told the other how hard my thrusters pushed in pounds.

2
00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:15.000
The other computer thought the numbers were in newtons. Nobody noticed.

3
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:21.950
The tiny mistake grew and grew on my nine-month trip, and I reached Mars far too low.

4
00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:26.350
I slipped behind the planet and never came out.

5
00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:31.440
Pound-force or newtons? Nobody checked.
